stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "确定座次" as determining_order
    state "选择起始道具" as choosing_item
    state "等待行动" as awaiting_action
    state "等待事件选择" as awaiting_event
    state "等待道具取舍" as awaiting_item
    state "对局结束" as game_over
    [*] --> determining_order: 创建对局
    determining_order --> determining_order: 同点小组重投
    determining_order --> choosing_item: 座次确定

    choosing_item --> choosing_item: 下一位选择起始道具
    choosing_item --> awaiting_action: 全员选择完成

    awaiting_action --> awaiting_action: 使用主动道具
    awaiting_action --> awaiting_event: 投骰并落入事件格
    awaiting_action --> awaiting_action: 移动完成，切换行动者
    awaiting_action --> game_over: 抵达终点

    awaiting_event --> awaiting_item: 获得道具且需要取舍
    awaiting_event --> awaiting_action: 事件结算 / 切换回合
    awaiting_event --> game_over: 事件效果抵达终点

    awaiting_item --> awaiting_action: 保留或替换道具
    game_over --> [*]

    note right of awaiting_action
      服务端只接受当前合法命令
      随机结果由 Authority 产生
    end note

    note right of awaiting_event
      领域状态与动画状态分离
      动画不参与规则推进
    end note
